div.p:
[Here follow sixteen numbered paragraphs indicating the several categories of aid
                    and their dollar amounts. The categories comprised arsenals and repair shops;
                    training aid; ammunition; communication and electronic equipment; medical
                    equipment; ordnance equipment; aircraft; airdromes; meteorology; ships;
                    torpedoes, depth charges, mines and minesweeper gear; net and boom material;
                    fuel oil; general naval supplies; ports arid highways; and engineering
                    equipment.]
